# Conformance probe pack for the field option `null` (spec 0.56) on `json`.
# Public. No kinds. `x` has a default and `code` a sentinel, which come
# before `null`; `s` is one member bound to two keys (ruling 16 of 0.5), so
# `null` is written only when neither writes a value.
format  conformance-null-json
version 0.56.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    json
field   uid          id     string
field   probe.label  label  string  null
field   probe.qty    q      int     null
field   probe.x      x      int     null
default probe.x      7
field   probe.tag    code   string  absent N/A  null
field   probe.s1     s      string  null
field   probe.s2     s      string
group   probe.items  items
  field  probe.label  name  string  null
  field  probe.qty    q     int
end
